create a project as a desktop app in python, what it does is:
1. analyze a log file, which is a txt file
2. the log file is to capture performance test for salesforce industries CPQ Quting process for a specific implementation
3. each line of the log will have timestamp in linux format with milliseconds precision
4. for each executed and logged method, there will be a line for entering and another line for exiting
5. there will be nested similar lines for child methods to many levels deep
6. the app should be able to extract the data from the log file and display it in a chart
7. the chart should be able to show the time taken for each method to execute
8. critical path of execution for the whole quote process should be highlighted in the chart
9. the source code should be in its own folder with name source
10. utilize most related libraries and frameworks to build the app like pandas, matplotlib, seaborn, etc.
11. the app should be able to run on macos
12. the app should be able to run on python 3.10 or higher
13. for now it will be a local desktop app, later it will be a web app supporting nextjs framework in javascripts

